obi, Kenya</span></div></div></div></div></footer></div><script>requestAnimationFrame(function(){$RT=performance.now()});</script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/3s6nzrbk-8mnv.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><div hidden id=\"S:0\"><main class=\"bg-ssl-light-bg min-h-screen py-20\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6\"><div style=\"animation-timeline:view();animation-range:entry 0% cover 35%;animation-fill-mode:both;animation-name:slide-up-in;animation-duration:1s;animation-timing-function:ease-out\" class=\"jsx-1138063265 \"><div class=\"mb-12 flex flex-col items-center text-center\"><div class=\"mb-6 flex h-16 w-16 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-ssl-blue/10 text-ssl-blue\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-users h-8 w-8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.128a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.744\"></path><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle></svg></div><h1 class=\"mb-4 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ssl-bg md:text-5xl\">Marketing &amp; Sales Capacity Building</h1><p class=\"text-lg text-slate-600\">We train and equip your in-house marketing and sales teams with modern playbooks, tools, and workflows — building lasting internal capability, not just outsourced campaigns.</p></div></div><div class=\"space-y-16\"><div style=\"animation-delay:0s\" class=\"jsx-1138063265 \"><section><h2 class=\"mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-ssl-bg\">The Problem</h2><div class=\"glass-card-light rounded-xl p-8\"><p class=\"text-slate-600 leading-relaxed\">Hiring an agency for every campaign gets expensive, and once the contract ends, your team is back to square one with no new skills gained.</p></div></section></div><div style=\"animation-delay:0.1s\" class=\"jsx-1138063265 \"><section><h2 class=\"mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-ssl-bg\">Our Approach</h2><div class=\"glass-card-light rounded-xl p-8\"><p class=\"text-slate-600 leading-relaxed\">We train your in-house marketing and sales teams directly, sharing the same playbooks, tools, and workflows we use ourselves, so your team can run campaigns and manage the pipeline without needing us for every task.</p></div></section></div><div style=\"animation-delay:0.2s\" class=\"jsx-1138063265 \"><section><h2 class=\"mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-ssl-bg\">The Outcome</h2><div class=\"glass-card-light rounded-xl p-8\"><p class=\"text-slate-600 leading-relaxed\">A marketing and sales team that keeps improving after we&#x27;re done, and less long-term dependency on outside agencies.</p></div></section></div><div style=\"animation-delay:0.3s\" class=\"jsx-1138063265 \"><section><h2 class=\"mb-8 text-2xl font-bold text-ssl-bg text-center\">Common Questions</h2><div class=\"space-y-4\"><div class=\"glass-card-light overflow-hidden rounded-xl border\"><button class=\"flex w-full items-center justify-between p-6 text-left\"><span class=\"font-semibold text-ssl-bg\">Are you training our whole team or just a few people?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-5 w-5 text-ssl-blue transition-transform duration-300\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button><div class=\"grid transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out grid-rows-[0fr] opacity-0\"><div class=\"overflow-hidden\"><p class=\"px-6 pb-6 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed\">We can do either. Some companies want their whole team trained, others prefer we start with a smaller group who then teach the rest.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"glass-card-light overflow-hidden rounded-xl border\"><button class=\"flex w-full items-center justify-between p-6 text-left\"><span class=\"font-semibold text-ssl-bg\">What happens after the training ends?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-5 w-5 text-ssl-blue transition-transform duration-300\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button><div class=\"grid transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out grid-rows-[0fr] opacity-0\"><div class=\"overflow-hidden\"><p class=\"px-6 pb-6 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed\">You keep the playbooks, tools, and workflows we build together. Your team can keep running with them long after our engagement ends.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"glass-card-light overflow-hidden rounded-xl border\"><button class=\"flex w-full items-center justify-between p-6 text-left\"><span class=\"font-semibold text-ssl-bg\">Is this instead of hiring an agency, or alongside one?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-5 w-5 text-ssl-blue transition-transform duration-300\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button><div class=\"grid transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out grid-rows-[0fr] opacity-0\"><div class=\"overflow-hidden\"><p class=\"px-6 pb-6 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed\">It can be either. Some clients use this to eventually stop needing an agency. Others keep working with us for bigger projects while their team handles the day to day.</p></div></div></div></div></section></div></div><div style=\"animation-timeline:view();animation-range:entry 0% cover 35%;animation-fill-mode:both;animation-name:slide-up-in;animation-duration:1s;animation-timing-function:ease-out\" class=\"jsx-1138063265 mt-20\"><section><h2 class=\"mb-8 text-center text-2xl font-bold text-ssl-bg\">Related Services</h2><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 md:grid-cols-3\"><a href=\"/services/technical-infrastructure-web-dev\"><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-ssl-gold/15 bg-ssl-bg transition-all duration-300 ease-out hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-ssl-gold/5 hover:scale-[1.015] hover:-translate-y-0.5 overflow-hidden flex h-full flex-col p-6 hover:border-ssl-blue/40\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-white\">Technical Infrastructure &amp; Web Dev</h3></div></a><a href=\"/services/algorithmic-search\"><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-ssl-gold/15 bg-ssl-bg transition-all duration-300 ease-out hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-ssl-gold/5 hover:scale-[1.015] hover:-translate-y-0.5 overflow-hidden flex h-full flex-col p-6 hover:border-ssl-blue/40\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-white\">Algorithmic Search (SEO/AEO/GEO)</h3></div></a><a href=\"/services/data-systems-automation\"><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-ssl-gold/15 bg-ssl-bg transition-all duration-300 ease-out hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-ssl-gold/5 hover:scale-[1.015] hover:-translate-y-0.5 overflow-hidden flex h-full flex-col p-6 hover:border-ssl-blue/40\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-white\">Data Systems &amp; Automation</h3></div></a></div></section></div><div style=\"animation-timeline:view();animation-range:entry 0% cover 35%;animation-fill-mode:both;animation-name:slide-up-in;animation-duration:1s;animation-timing-function:ease-out\" class=\"jsx-1138063265 mt-20 text-center\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-md focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-1 focus-visible:ring-slate-950 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 dark:focus-visible:ring-slate-300 text-[#01081b] font-medium transition-colors h-11 px-8 text-base bg-ssl-blue hover:bg-ssl-blue/90\" href=\"/#contact\">Start a Project</a></div></div></main><!--$--><!--/$--></div><script>$RB=[];$RV=function(a){$RT